Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.39,0:00:04.71,On Top,#Title,0,0,0,,LIEWEI'S TRAP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.47,0:00:05.86,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,So that's how it is, Li Mu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.86,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In this moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.33,0:00:16.02,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Wang Jian could almost hear Lord Changping's \Nplan for storming Yè crumbling into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.45,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:27.20,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,I couldn't even do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:31.76,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,I got through those insane tryouts, \Nall that brutal training--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:34.63,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,and when the time came,\NI couldn't do a damn thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:35.76,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:37.77,MX Default,Recruit A,0,0,0,,I know it was our first campaign,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:40.89,MX Default,Recruit A,0,0,0,,but I really thought we could \Nhave done more out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:43.52,MX Default,Dun Jiao,0,0,0,,Huh? Don't lump us in with you losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.38,MX Default,Dun Jiao,0,0,0,,{\i1}We{\i0} killed five of the bastards each.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.38,0:00:49.02,MX Default,Dun Gao,0,0,0,,Guess the rest of youse are all talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:51.00,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,We're {\i1}what{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:52.82,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Say that again, Dun Brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.82,0:00:54.95,MX Default,Dun Jiao,0,0,0,,Ooh, it's All-Talk Gan Dou.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:56.45,MX Default,Dun Gao,0,0,0,,Wanna make somethin' of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:58.41,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,I'll kill the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.34,0:01:02.19,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,--Damn damn damn damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.78,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,--H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:04.59,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Oh, for heaven's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.04,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Commander Song Zuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.79,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,You newbies actually made it through alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.79,0:01:10.90,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Celebrate, why don't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:12.86,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,We brought liquor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.88,MX Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.88,0:01:16.80,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Drink up, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:22.04,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,I got the good stuff from Xin--they only \Ngive it to brigade commanders on up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:25.40,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Hmm? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.11,0:01:29.06,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Some guys got hurt bad, others even died...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:33.10,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Honestly, we're not really \Nin a drinking mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:36.98,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,You dum-dum. That's {\i1}why{\i0} you drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:40.78,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Like, "I'm still alive, dammit!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:44.70,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Plus, you only get "night after your \Nfirst battle" drinks once per lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.87,0:01:49.38,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Really savor its taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:51.38,MX Default,Ping Lai,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.16,0:01:56.85,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Commander Chong Yuan...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.33,0:01:59.59,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for what you did today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:03.85,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,If you hadn't saved us, \Nwe would have been goners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:07.69,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,If it was worth a thank-you, \Nhurry up and get stronger instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:09.06,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,All-Talk Gan Dou.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.85,0:02:11.17,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.89,0:02:18.48,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Listen to you. On {\i1}your{\i0} first campaign,\N you were so scared you wet yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.20,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:21.64,MX Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Whaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.69,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Is that true, Chong Yuan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.69,0:02:25.20,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:28.58,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,I was around 17 at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.58,0:02:32.71,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,After that they called me \NPisspants Chong Yuan for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:34.78,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}that's{\i0} embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:37.37,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Worse than my own wartime debut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.37,0:02:40.54,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,I've got some dirt on Chong Yuan at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.54,0:02:41.68,MX Default,Meng,0,0,0,,Wei Ping...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.63,0:02:47.39,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,'Course, I went on to beat those guys \Nto within an inch of their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.63,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,A-As one does.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:52.15,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, where are those two, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.49,0:02:53.71,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Which two?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.71,0:02:57.65,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Those brothers who pulled off \Nunbelievable feats in their debut!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.65,0:02:59.11,MX Default,Dun Gao & Dun Jiao,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:01.14,MX Default,Dun Gao & Dun Jiao,0,0,0,,You mean us, the Dun Brothers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:03.07,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Get lost, {\i1}Dung{\i0} Bros!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.69,0:03:06.09,MX Default,Newbie,0,0,0,,You mean the Bow Bros, Ren and Dan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:07.83,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Yeah, Ren and Dan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:12.54,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,I heard their arrows practically \Nbrought down the whole castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:17.42,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,It would be more accurate to say the \Nlittle guy--the big brother--was amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.91,0:03:20.36,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,None of younger bro's arrows were hitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:22.57,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,Froze up completely halfway through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.15,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:28.24,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,I see. That's a little worrisome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.24,0:03:29.64,MX Default,Chong Yuan,0,0,0,,For both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:30.69,MX Default,Song Zuo,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:32.54,MX Default,Gan Dou,0,0,0,,"Both of them"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:48.79,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:50.79,MX Default,Qin Soldier Walla,0,0,0,,Long live the Qin army!\NLong live the Qin army!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.92,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,It's over, Dan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.12,0:03:55.52,MX Default,Cang Dan,0,0,0,,Bro...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:58.05,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Now {\i1}think{\i0} about what you've done!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.72,0:04:11.47,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,This castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.85,0:04:23.40,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Miss Tactician!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:29.11,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for giving you such a big \Nrole in your very first battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:31.62,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,I'm glad you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:36.99,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,But once it began, it was all so \Ndifferent from what we'd expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:39.67,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Your hand's shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:43.42,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,It was my first time shooting people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:49.13,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,I'm sorry you have such a \Nweakling in the Fei Xin Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:50.93,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,It must be a real let-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:52.66,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:56.19,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,You accomplished more \Nthan anyone on our squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.03,0:04:58.13,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,And what's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.10,0:05:02.81,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,That tremor is what shows \Nyou're Fei Xin Force material.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.81,0:05:04.65,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Your kindness and weakness--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.06,0:05:07.66,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,they're proof you can grow even stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:15.67,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:10.99,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,We've all grown by \Nhitting our own personal walls
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:13.73,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,and then getting past them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:15.67,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,That goes for Xin, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:17.46,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,And me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:20.67,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I was scared at first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:25.42,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Controlling the battle, killing \Nenemies... and allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.09,0:05:29.77,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,But the Fei Xin Force is fine with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:34.68,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,It's by our weakness that we \Ncan know our true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.99,0:05:40.69,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Someone who just gleefully kills left \Nand right in their first battle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.31,0:05:45.19,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,should skip the Fei Xin Force \Nand join Huan Yi's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.31,0:05:47.29,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,So that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.47,0:05:53.48,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,this shaking hand is nothing \Nto be ashamed of, Ren.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.77,0:06:01.62,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:06.22,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,My hand may still be shaking, \Nbut I feel a little lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.72,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Yeah? Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.47,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,I'm going to look for my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.47,0:06:13.10,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,I came down on him pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.43,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,He's probably moping around somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:17.63,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,You're such a big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.63,0:06:20.35,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm all he has.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:24.89,MX Default,Cang Ren,0,0,0,,And he's my one and only little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:31.60,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Oh, right! I have to report on the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.42,MX Default,Qin General A,0,0,0,,--What do you mean, no one's seen him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.71,0:06:37.42,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,--Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.72,MX Default,Qin Soldier A,0,0,0,,We don't know what's going on, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:42.34,MX Default,Qin Soldier A,0,0,0,,But Ma Kuang told us not to get worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:44.92,MX Default,Qin General A,0,0,0,,And where is Ma Kuang now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.34,0:06:45.92,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:48.17,MX Default,Qin Soldier A,0,0,0,,--W-We're searching for him as we speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:48.17,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,--What's all this fuss about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.69,0:06:50.88,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,So you're here too, Diao.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:52.95,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Oh, Yang Duanhe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.89,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I had something to tell \NGeneral Wang Jian, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:07:02.31,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,As did I, but it seems commanding \Ngeneral Wang Jian has vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.31,0:07:03.18,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,He {\i1}what?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.23,MX Default,Zhao Messenger A,0,0,0,,Urgent message!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:07.90,MX Default,Zhao Messenger A,0,0,0,,Liewei has been conquered! Liewei has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:09.36,MX Default,Aide A,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:17.91,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:12.57,MX Default,Aide A,0,0,0,,Was General Gongsun Long too late?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:15.66,MX Default,Zhao Messenger A,0,0,0,,It seems his army turned back \Nand took up position in Yangtu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.66,0:07:17.91,MX Default,Aide A,0,0,0,,What? Why didn't they attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.91,0:07:21.26,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it. He followed my orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.10,0:07:27.00,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,It's all right. Liewei is home \Nto a certain secret of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.51,MX Default,Fu Di,0,0,0,,A secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:34.26,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,What do you mean, the commanding \Ngeneral's gone missing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.57,0:07:36.51,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,We're looking into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:39.23,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Is there a message or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.40,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,Well... yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.40,0:07:46.06,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,From his aide Ya Guang,\Nwhom we think left with him:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.06,0:07:48.94,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,"All troops, stand by in \NLiewei for three days."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:50.19,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.19,0:07:54.41,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,Oh, shut it, girlie! \NWe're just as thrown as you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.41,0:07:57.39,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,But if we waste three days here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.39,0:08:00.37,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,what's even the point of having \Ngotten the jump on Li Mu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:03.12,MX Default,Qin General B,0,0,0,,Quit yelling at {\i1}us{\i0} about it, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.57,0:08:05.97,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Is that really all of the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:10.88,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,He didn't say anything about Liewei's castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.36,MX Default,Huan Yi Underling A,0,0,0,,Hey, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:20.31,MX Default,Huan Yi Underling A,0,0,0,,Big commotion over at HQ! \NThey say Wang Jian's gone missin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:21.27,MX Default,Hei Ying,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:22.77,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,Missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.48,MX Default,Lei Tu,0,0,0,,The hell's that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.96,0:08:27.19,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Probably because this castle's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.40,MX Default,Hei Ying,0,0,0,,Did you say something, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:32.19,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.16,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(173,22)}WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.66,0:08:38.16,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(475,22)}QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.69,0:08:38.16,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Wang Jian had been missing for two days,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.66,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and the Qin army hadn't budged from Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:45.17,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Of course, the true reason was \Nknown only to the higher-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:49.55,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The troops believed they were \Nresting up for their next march.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:56.06,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Well, that's everybody, Meng Tian.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:56.97,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:59.93,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,You tricked me, mountain woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.37,0:09:02.73,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,I didn't say we'd be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.42,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,But I do want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.42,0:09:08.15,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,I'd like your opinion, General Huan Yi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:11.63,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,That's the general's seat, Xin. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:12.11,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:13.61,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Hey, Wang Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.43,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Move over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:16.32,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Get bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.07,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wha--Wang Ben, you little--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.07,0:09:19.00,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Xin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:21.49,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Just get this over with, Meng Tian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.49,0:09:22.37,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.35,0:09:26.12,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Getting straight to the point,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:30.54,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,the castle here at Liewei was \Npurposely built to be weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.00,0:09:37.05,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:39.55,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What the hell's that supposed \Nto mean, Meng Tian?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.99,0:09:42.59,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} stormed the place--didn't you notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.13,0:09:46.02,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,For a national gate, it was a real pushover.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.02,0:09:47.47,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,The hell it was!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:50.98,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,More like the Fei Xin Force and the \Nmountainfolk were too damn powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:52.68,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Calm down, Xin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:56.40,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,After inspecting this place \Nfor two days, I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:10:01.18,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,The weird height of the walls, \Nthe irregular lines of flow--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.41,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,It was purposely \Nbuilt to be hard to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:10.15,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,And I'm betting General Wang \NJian realized it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.68,0:10:14.17,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Why would he go missing \Nbecause of that, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:17.13,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that much I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.88,0:10:21.99,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,I mean, why'd they even want Liewei \Nto be weak in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.99,0:10:23.60,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,It's Zhao's national gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:26.60,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,So it's easy to take back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.64,0:10:32.26,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,If Liewei were a strong castle, \Nit would become untouchable to Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.26,0:10:35.15,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,the moment an enemy captured it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:36.80,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:39.79,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,they made it easy to capture on purpose,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:42.84,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,so that if an enemy \Ninvades the capital region,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:56.98,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(90,278)}LIEWEI
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:56.98,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(547,173)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.84,0:10:46.90,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Zhao can take Liewei back again \Nand block the only way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.64,0:10:53.22,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,The Zhao army would surround the Qin army, \Nwith the Yellow River blocking the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:57.01,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Then they'd just take\N their time annihilating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.01,0:10:57.97,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:02.31,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,It's not a {\i1}common{\i0} defensive strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:07.89,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,actually luring in an army that's\N slogging toward your capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.89,0:11:10.35,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,A-A strategy like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:13.59,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,...could only have been \Ncrafted by one person:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:16.11,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Li Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.69,Italics,Xin,0,0,0,,Li Mu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.57,0:11:21.42,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,D-Don't be standin' around all impressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:26.29,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,We got ahead of the guy, so now \Nwe come up with a plan to--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.29,0:11:27.15,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,There's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:28.06,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wang Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:29.31,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Don't you realize?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:33.83,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,This whole campaign hinged on \Nholding onto an impregnable Liewei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.83,0:11:37.38,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,so we could keep our supply line secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:41.00,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Now Lord Changping's great strategy has been
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:44.01,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,smashed to smithereens from the ground up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.01,0:11:46.01,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.55,0:11:54.90,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Weird to be saying this from the absent \Ncommanding general's seat, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.01,0:12:00.26,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Right now I see us as having \Nthree options in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.35,0:12:05.73,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,One: We leave more troops in Liewei \Nthan we'd originally planned
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.73,0:12:07.73,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,and storm the capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.20,0:12:12.08,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,But could we still take down \Nour real target of Yè that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.39,0:12:14.29,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,I highly doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.33,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:20.05,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,It's impossible--which is why we came \Nas such a huge allied army instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:24.42,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Two: We patch up Liewei's \Nweaknesses and get it to where
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.42,0:12:26.80,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,it can withstand a siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.27,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,C-Could we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.32,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:33.59,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Just how long do you think that would take?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.55,0:12:39.32,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Embark on something that slow and \Ntedious, and Li Mu's sure to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.32,0:12:41.57,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,We'll never be able to leave Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.07,0:12:43.28,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:47.72,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Then I guess we might only have \Nthe third option after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.29,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What is it, Meng Tian? \NWhat's this third option?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:55.29,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Pretty sure everyone but Xin \Nis already thinking it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.42,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,A full retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:04.34,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What?! Are you kiddin' me, Meng Tian?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.34,0:13:06.59,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,After we made it this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:09.93,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,If our teacher's strategy's \Ngone up in smoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:11.54,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,that really is all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:12.10,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Diao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:15.30,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,This isn't a battle that \Ncan be won on momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.91,0:13:18.53,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,Barge in unprepared
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:22.07,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,and these 200 thousand troops \Nreally will be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.37,0:13:23.78,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Not you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:27.78,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Want to tell us why you're smiling,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.78,0:13:29.35,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,General Huan Yi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:32.49,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,You bunch of small fry--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:33.75,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,you really are young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:34.50,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.94,0:13:36.75,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.07,0:13:42.71,MX Default,Hei Ying,0,0,0,,Why isn't there a fourth \Noption in there, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.71,0:13:44.21,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,A-A fourth...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.21,0:13:45.72,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,...option?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.72,0:13:54.97,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,We abandon Liewei, the whole army \Nsurges into the capital region,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.97,0:13:58.77,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,and we capture Yè before \Nour supplies run out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.77,0:14:01.23,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,That's too reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:03.67,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,And {\i1}that's{\i0} why you're small fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:05.24,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Don't you get it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:13.16,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,He's out there racin' as we speak--\Nto see if that option's available.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.61,0:14:20.72,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Around that time, Wang Jian finally \Nlaid eyes upon his destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.37,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.61,0:14:30.95,On Top - More Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO'S SECOND CITY, YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.98,MX Default,Aide B,0,0,0,,So this is Yè!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:43.33,MX Default,Wang Jian Aide A,0,0,0,,Wh-What's with that massive watchtower?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:50.40,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,It's quite different from what I'd heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.40,0:14:55.54,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,Seems the rumors were true that Li Mu \Nhad made major changes in recent years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.01,0:14:59.54,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,To a foolish general, its defenses\Nmust seem merely oddly designed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.05,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.57,0:15:10.55,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,A perfect castle. \NThat castle can't be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.30,0:15:15.81,MX Default,Aide A,0,0,0,,Th-Then what of the allied army's campaign?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:17.41,MX Default,Aide B,0,0,0,,Wang Jian, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.41,0:15:18.31,MX Default,Aide C,0,0,0,,General Wang Jian!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:22.19,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Ya Guang, bring out the map of all \Ncastles in the royal capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.19,0:15:22.88,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:29.57,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Are there indeed eight castles \Nalong the way to Yè?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:36.08,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,No. Our scouts suggest there's another \Nsmaller city northwest of Jiyin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.30,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,How many {\i1}li{\i0} northwest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:40.28,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,About twenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:44.59,Italics,Aide A,0,0,0,,S-Surely he doesn't intend to \Nproduce a strategy on the spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:49.55,Italics,Aide B,0,0,0,,Ridiculous. In the very heart of \NZhao's capital region?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.98,0:15:54.38,Italics,Aide D,0,0,0,,If the enemy found us here, \Nwe'd be done for...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:59.43,MX Default,Zhao Soldier A,0,0,0,,You there! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.93,0:16:03.90,MX Default,Zhao Soldier A,0,0,0,,You're not Yè soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:05.94,MX Default,Zhao Soldier A,0,0,0,,What's your regiment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.27,0:16:13.33,MX Default,Zhao Soldier C,0,0,0,,What's all that racket?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.23,0:16:16.42,MX Default,Aide C,0,0,0,,There's a whole squadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:18.12,MX Default,Aide A,0,0,0,,Quickly, General...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:19.62,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Ya Guang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.33,0:16:22.62,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,About twice our number.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.30,0:16:24.37,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:26.13,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,To your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:36.03,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(173,22)}WANG
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:36.03,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(475,22)}QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.53,0:16:36.05,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Another two days later...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.95,0:16:38.06,MX Default,Qin Soldier C,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:41.02,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,...Wang Jian, having returned to Liewei,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:44.85,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,issued orders to the allied army commanders.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.75,0:16:50.98,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Some of you may have already realized this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:57.24,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,but Lord Changping's strategy for storming Yè\N has disintegrated here in Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.17,0:17:02.33,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Therefore, this allied \Narmy will use {\i1}my{\i0} strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.25,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,and move past Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.25,Italics,Diao,0,0,0,,General Wang Jian's strategy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.75,Italics,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,...to move...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.26,Italics,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,...past Liewei?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:13.51,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,In other words, what we have now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:18.01,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,is a battle of wits between \NWang Jian and Li Mu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.01,0:17:22.43,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,All troops, gather the \Nprovisions and move out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.30,0:17:25.89,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,We're taking Yè!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.42,0:17:32.12,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The allied Qin army began their advance: \Npast Liewei, the national gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.12,0:17:34.44,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,and into the Zhao capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.55,0:17:38.01,On Top - More Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,QIE, ZHAO (TWO DAYS FROM YANXIE)
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.17,MX Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,An urgent message by bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.24,MX Default,Li Mu Aide A,0,0,0,,They what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:40.53,MX Default,Li Mu Aide B,0,0,0,,Can that be true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:43.50,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,They've come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:48.29,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,I gave you a siege with no way out.\NDid you detect some shot at victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:53.05,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,If so... you've completely \Nmisread the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.66,0:17:54.62,Italics,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Wang Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:18:00.70,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,General Hu Zhe is currently west \Nof the mountains, traveling south.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:02.15,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Order him by bird to attack Liewei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.15,0:18:03.31,MX Default,"About 3" Aides,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.04,0:18:07.34,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Send the same message to all \Narmies in the capital region.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:08.81,MX Default,Li Mu,0,0,0,,Time for a siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:13.28,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Word that the Qin allied army \Nhad passed through Liewei
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:16.79,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,reached the other nations \Nin the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:20.16,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Oho.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:25.11,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Looks like Qin is serious \Nabout offing Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.11,0:18:27.97,MX Default,Civil Servant Walla,0,0,0,,Qin did what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:29.14,On Top - More Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,CHU ROYAL COURT
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:31.42,MX Default,Li Yuan,0,0,0,,Will Zhao be conquered?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.82,0:18:33.51,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Hardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:37.09,MX Default,Li Yuan,0,0,0,,Then Qin will fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:38.34,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:42.81,MX Default,Ba Miu,0,0,0,,So Qin's blade won't reach Handan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:43.31,MX Default,Ba Miu,0,0,0,,Urk!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:45.56,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Not Handan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.57,0:18:50.56,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,They want what's right below it: Yè.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.56,0:18:54.57,MX Default,Li Yuan,0,0,0,,Then you mean the Qin army \Nwon't be able to conquer Yè?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.57,0:18:56.32,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Right. It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.71,0:18:58.38,MX Default,Li Yuan,0,0,0,,How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:01.07,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,The Zhao royal capital region
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:03.25,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,is overwhelmingly easy to defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.25,0:19:07.83,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,Even if a foe gets inside, once Zhao can \Nremove their exits and seal them in,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.15,0:19:11.64,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,they'll have no more air to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.41,0:19:18.84,MX Default,Li Yuan,0,0,0,,Then shouldn't we beef up our forces \Nto the north, while we still can?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:23.30,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,You're starting to get the hang \Nof this war thing, Li Yuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.41,0:19:26.85,MX Default,Wa Lin,0,0,0,,But there's no need to panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:29.83,On Top - More Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,YIZI, WEI FRONT LINES
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:31.67,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,You know those two-pump chumps \Nin Wei will make a move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:35.86,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Then Meng Wu's army, currently \Nin a face-off against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:39.02,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,will have its attention \Ndivided in holding back Wei--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.88,0:19:39.59,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,QIN
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:44.62,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Which is when our Chu army can blast north \Nto Xianyang, crushing all in its path!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.87,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Once we take Qin, it'll be as good as over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:50.89,MX Default,Wei Ping,0,0,0,,Then the Middle Kingdom will belong to Chu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.84,0:20:00.71,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I-I just can't shake my misgivings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.71,0:20:02.84,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,This advance really is too reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:08.31,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Choosing to abandon Liewei and \Nattack Yè while we still have provisions?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:14.27,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Frankly, anyone who knows tactics \Nknows this is the worst one to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:20.22,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,It's nothing less than the suicide mission \Nyou described in Xianyang, Wang Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:26.24,MX Default,Meng Tian,0,0,0,,Though I think you're the only one here \Nwho could chide General Wang Jian...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.77,0:20:30.86,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,It's the commanding general's decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:34.42,MX Default,Wang Ben,0,0,0,,We have only to risk our lives at our posts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:40.83,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Wang Ben...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.32,0:20:42.78,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,HUAN
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:44.26,MX Default,Lei Tu,0,0,0,,No, we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.72,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,But we will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:49.18,MX Default,Hei Ying,0,0,0,,Will we, boss? Be wiped out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:51.39,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,If we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.39,0:20:52.91,MX Default,Lei Tu,0,0,0,,So we win, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.91,0:20:54.86,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,And how will we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:56.33,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.33,0:21:00.50,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,Not even the boss knows how \Nto win this. Which means?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.50,0:21:02.55,MX Default,Lei Tu,0,0,0,,I said we'd win, and that's final.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.55,0:21:06.01,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,Oh, Great Tactician Lei Tu, \Nif you would be so kind,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:10.95,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,grace the dunderhead Mo Lun with \Nthe wisdom of your strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.95,0:21:13.40,MX Default,Lei Tu,0,0,0,,Aw, can it. You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:18.17,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,You wanna hear the one \Nthing I {\i1}do{\i0} know, Mo Lun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.17,0:21:19.25,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.26,0:21:25.76,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,As far as I know, that bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:28.96,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,never starts a war he'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:33.73,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,The first move in Wang Jian's \Nstrategy for the Yè offensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:35.69,MX Default,Yang Duanhe,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:41.51,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,...was for the mountainfolk army's \N50 thousand troops to march northeast
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.52,On Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(174,90)}YANG DUANHE
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.52,On Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(174,175)}WANG JIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:41.52,On Top,#Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(174,259)}HUAN YI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.51,0:21:45.08,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,to fight Gongsun Long's 90 \Nthousand troops in Yangtu,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.11,0:21:43.17,MX Default - Right Align,#Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(616,68)}GONGSUN LONG
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.08,0:21:47.57,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,where the front lines had been drawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.76,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,FEI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:51.79,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:55.25,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,More marching along with \Nfriendly troops as our shield?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:22:01.21,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,We have no choice. This allied \Narmy can only fight for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:08.39,MX Default,Troop Walla,0,0,0,,Look--it's our provisions!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:10.00,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Diao, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:12.35,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,The allied army's lifeline!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.15,0:22:16.60,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,We have to conquer Yè \Nbefore that runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.84,0:22:22.64,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,Ya Guang.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.64,0:22:23.32,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:26.28,MX Default,Wang Jian,0,0,0,,We're changing course. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.74,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,Changing course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.30,0:22:30.74,MX Default,Ya Guang,0,0,0,,Get word to the rear units, too! Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.74,0:22:32.54,MX Default,Qin General Walla,0,0,0,,We're changing course!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.85,MX Default,Qin General Walla,0,0,0,,Follow the front units!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:35.03,MX Default,Qin General Walla,0,0,0,,Don't lose sight of 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:37.46,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,What the--did he find a shortcut?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.07,0:22:39.46,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.08,0:22:44.17,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Odd... this {\i1}should{\i0} be the \Nshortest route to Yè.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.17,0:22:44.93,MX Default,Lei Tu,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.93,0:22:47.13,MX Default,Mo Lun,0,0,0,,What might this mean, bossman?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.56,0:22:49.60,MX Default,Huan Yi,0,0,0,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.60,0:22:52.20,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,In fact, at that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.20,0:22:56.64,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Wang Jian was arcing the main army's \N150 thousand troops greatly northward.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.83,0:22:56.62,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,{\pos(509,24)}YÈ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.66,0:22:58.83,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,ZHAO
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.85,0:23:01.31,MX Default,Watchman,0,0,0,,Th-The Qin army!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:08.28,MX Default,Xin,0,0,0,,Diao... why is Wang Jian doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:10.03,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.61,0:23:13.72,MX Default,Diao,0,0,0,,Why lead us to a tiny town that \Nhas nothing to do with Yè?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:18.58,MX Default - Right Align,Caption,0,0,0,,TRANSLATION: NORA STEVENS HEATH \NTIMING: HENRY LIN\NEDITING AND QA: SARAH ALYS LINDHOLM
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.02,0:24:54.99,On Top,Caption,0,0,0,,WEAPONS OF CONQUEST
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.23,0:24:52.84,Italics,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next on Kingdom: "Weapons of Conquest."

